om/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-05-15T09:47:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T13:56:44Z","closed_at":"2025-08-18T13:56:41Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.dev3.official [28089c40c], v4.5.dev3.mono.official [28089c40c], v4.5.dev4.official [209a446e3], v4.5.dev4.mono.official [209a446e3], v4.5.dev.mono.gh [428a762e9], v4.5.dev.mono.gh [45fc515ae], v4.5.dev5.official [64b09905c]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6], v4.5.dev1.official [97241ffea], v4.5.dev1.mono.official [97241ffea], v4.5.dev2.official [af2c71397], v4.5.dev2.mono.official [af2c71397]\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint Cinnamon 22.1 | AMD Ryzen 5500U | Acer Aspire 5 | x11\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you right-click anywhere it spawns a new window which closes automatically only if you right-click in the same origin window (the one you first opened the context menu from). So like if i right-click in the file explorer i can get one menu, but if i right-click in the scene tree and file explorer i can get two!\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1238dc15-3207-44db-b9ae-e79c605cddf7)\n\nBehavior differs slightly between dev3, dev3 mono, dev4 and dev4 mono, but the point is they all spawn new window frames that at first look like they can be alt-tabbed into, but it's clearly a bug and not supposed to happen because the menus automatically close when you unfocus from the engine or press esc and they have a thing that makes them \"appear on top\" always.\n\nVery important - i think i hear multiple clicks when i open the bugged engine versions too as i have a sound for when a new window opens. Also i remember somehow managing to cause the bugged engine to have a blank rectangle that i could not close and had to terminate its task from my task manager. Not reproducible, idk how.\n\nWhen i gave Gemini the full changelog of 4.5-dev3 and the article it pointed me towards https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76829 which makes sense given how big of a change that is, but i have no idea what the change implies so i'm just going to say this is as far as i can direct you. It checks out as a commit made in 4.5-dev3 as this is where the issue starts from and it makes sense that the behavior differs slightly as people are fixing it up constantly. To make sure it hasn't been fixed i did test on v4.5.dev.mono.gh [428a762e9] which is the latest as of writing this.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload any of the versions specified from https://godotengine.org/download/archive/, specifically Linux Snadard and .NET. Make a project or open an already existing one. Right-click on different frames (scene tree, file manager, script window).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot project dependent, but i'll be safer than sorry.\n\nDownload any of the versions specified from https://godotengine.org/download/archive/, specifically Linux Snadard and .NET. Make a project or open an already existing one. Right-click.\n\n[right-click-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20225805/right-click-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106433/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106433/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}